				"⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				87,
				9
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Standardize build tooling configuration across Land workspace\n\nAdvance the Land workspace with coordinated tooling updates:\n\n- Format.sh: Add shell script formatting with shfmt, expand usage to support individual targets (shell, prettier, rust), update documentation to reflect new capabilities\n- rustfmt.toml: Add ignore paths to prevent corruption of prost-generated code in Mountain/Air/Grove Generated directories\n- .prettierignore: Add comprehensive ignore patterns for Dependency/, vendor, Documentation/, Target/, SideCar NODE trees, .github/, and .turbo\n- biome.json & Cargo.toml: Normalize array formatting to single-line for consistency\n- .gitattributes: Remove obsolete Target/debug and Target/release entries\n- .cargo/config: Reformat rustdocflags array to single line\n- Rust.yml: Fix action args formatting in CI workflow\n\nThis coordinated update standardizes formatting tooling across the Land workspace while preventing rustfmt from corrupting generated protobuf code.",
			"SHA": "a39f6c788fa2ccd1f3a2fb58e07b09747ab0fe83"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T05:14:18Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				87,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize build tooling and style improvements across Land submodules\n\nAdvance the Element submodule with coordinated updates across eight Land components:\n\n- Common: Add TypeScript declaration files for Workers Cloudflare API (Access, Decrypt, Encrypt, Get, Put, Redirect, Response interfaces)\n- Output: Add ESBuild configuration enabling dual-compiler build system alongside Rest for Cocoon extension host\n- Rest: Reorder imports logically and standardize quote style to single quotes\n- Sky: Normalize Astro build artifact formatting with consistent quotes and trailing newlines\n- Wind: Reformat ESBuild configuration from minified to readable format and remove obsolete .d.ts files\n- Worker: Simplify ESBuild target configuration structure with direct variable assignment\n- Mountain: Fix dialog options DTO structure and path formatting for OpenDialog/SaveDialog handlers\n- Grove: Fix import path to use PascalCase module name per CLAUDE.md conventions\n\nThis coordinated update standardizes build tooling across the Land ecosystem while fixing API mismatches in the dialog integration.",
			"SHA": "315e19c86d1c9520ecf4b0cda8f5ca6187af716b"
		}
